s=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay Island</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Dye</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.45.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">December 10th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<hr /><p>The Snowdrop is a sellable flower that can be found throughout the entire <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowlands</a>.\n</p><p>It can be sold to <a href=\"/wiki/Jer_Junkman\" title=\"Jer Junkman\">Jer Junkman</a> for <span style=\"color:#63BB37;\">200$</span> per snowdrop. It can also be turned into Dye by using a <b><a href=\"/wiki/Press_Machine\" title=\"Press Machine\">Press Machine</a></b>.\n</p><p>When put into a <a href=\"/wiki/Composter\" title=\"Composter\">Composter</a>, the snowdrop fills the composter by approximately 6%\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163624\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited